return"STALLED: "+b.Rem+" blocks left ("+bc+" buildable) - out of weld reach or missing components";}void Stall(Bay b){if(b.Starved||_now-b.LastProgress&lt;=StallSeconds)return;int n=b.Welders.Count;if(b.KickW!=null||n==0||_now-b.KickT&lt;StallSeconds)return;for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++){var w=b.Welders[(b.KickIdx+i)%n];bool fn=false;try{fn=w.IsFunctional;}catch(Exception){}if(!fn)continue;b.KickIdx=(b.KickIdx+i+1)%n;b.KickW=w;b.KickT=_now;SetOn(w,false);return;}}bool _stockSeen;bool StockEmpty(){if(_stock.Count==0)return false;foreach(var s in _stock){try{var inv=s.GetInventory(0);if(inv!=null&amp;&amp;inv.CurrentVolume.RawValue&gt;2000){
